# Game regression work

User requests fixes for best scores, arrow navigation, reduced motion and unwanted sound. Follow docs/README.md and its linked spec version 2.2. The parent coordinates and reviews; all code changes belong to subagents. Plan shared with user before implementation.

Run separate agents sequentially (one worker slot): best scores; board keyboard focus; reduced motion; silence; final verification. Each agent reads the loader and applicable context, owns its implementation and focused checks, and preserves earlier changes.

Best scores complete: storage.ts keeps original preferences for equal/worse scores and records improvements per size; GameStatus.tsx displays `none` for missing records. Existing storage/session regression checks pass (17 tests), all compiler projects pass. Completed-import behavior was preserved.
Keyboard complete: use-board-focus.ts restores clamped unmodified arrow movement and nearest scrolling; Board.tsx/Card.tsx thread its handler. Card ignores modified keyboard-synthesized clicks without preventing browser defaults or changing pointer clicks. art/face-sheet.tsx supplies its existing no-op to the new Card prop. Added a compact modifier/browser-default regression to tests/input-contract.e2e.test.ts. Six focused navigation, nearest-scroll, paused-Resume and hidden-DOM journeys passed, then both input-contract journeys passed after the modifier guard; 8 focused unit/static tests, complete typecheck/build and changed-file formatting passed. Full keyboard completion remains for final verification after silence is restored.
Motion complete: card.css disables the card transition and status.css disables the celebration animation under `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`. Normal 120ms transitions and one 600ms pulse are preserved. Current-source build/typecheck, both existing motion browser journeys and changed-CSS formatting passed on the named runtime combination. No extra tests needed for this covered CSS regression.
Sound: S01-S02 remove AudioContext/chime code from use-game.ts, keep announcements.

State: requirements and implementation inspected; baseline Git worktree clean. Node 26.12.1 and npm 11.20.0. Locked install succeeded. Use `git -c safe.directory=/work` for repository reads. Focused browser runs with NEON_PAIRS_NAMED_COMBINATION=1 verified Playwright 1.64.1 and Chromium 156.0.8078.4. Baseline unit failures were the two best-score checks (now passing) and the source audio audit (pending sound task). Open Forge Doctor currently fails with an internal ArgumentException; context/index work.

Next: assign silence and final-verification agents. Complete unit tests, current-source build, browser journeys and format check after all fixes. Record actual runtime evidence in README if needed. Remove this temporary record and refresh its catalogue when work is complete.

